"your dashboard. {blank_lines}If you don't have an account on {platform_name}"
" yet, click {register_label_strong} at the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Συνδεθήκατε επιτυχώς στον λογαριασμό σας στο {provider_name}, αλλά αυτός ο "
