msgstr "Η εγγραφή από αυτή τη χώρα δεν επιτρέπεται λόγω περιορισμών."

#. Translators: These instructions appear on the registration form,
#. immediately
#. below a field meant to hold the user's email address.
#: openedx/core/djangoapps/user_authn/views/registration_form.py:574
